# Bot2 builds a board on turn 2: four Moxen, Ravenous Robots, an Ornithopter and Engineered Explosives with X = 3 (so it
# is mana value 3 on the stack but 0 on the battlefield, CR 202.3e), and the two artifact spells it cast after Ravenous
# Robots made two 1/1 Robot tokens (mana value 0). The Starcage enters on turn 5 and exiles all of them, X permanent
# and tokens included. A token that is exiled ceases to exist (CR 111.7), so only the cards are in exile. On turn 7 the
# Starcage is exiled with Haywire Mite: the cards come back, the Explosives as a new object with no counters, and the
# tokens do not.

